ac.png?v=1780399331&width=650\" alt=\"Airflow Upper\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feat-copy\">\n      <span class=\"feat-num\">01</span>\n      <span class=\"feat-tag\">Upper</span>\n      <h2 class=\"feat-title\">Airflow Upper</h2>\n      <p class=\"feat-body\">PU and mesh combined to circulate air through every rally. Keeps feet cool, dry, and locked in - without sacrificing flexibility mid-game.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"feat\">\n    <div class=\"feat-img\">\n      <img src=\"https://in.hndrd.co/cdn/shop/files/Artboard3_53a1c466-4256-43ea-8a51-31ace5cafe7b.png?v=1780399330&width=650\" alt=\"Extended Heel Lock\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feat-copy\">\n      <span class=\"feat-num\">02</span>\n      <span class=\"feat-tag\">Heel</span>\n      <h2 class=\"feat-title\">Extended Heel Lock</h2>\n      <p class=\"feat-body\">Reinforced rearfoot structure keeps you stable on sharp cuts and lateral dives. Your heel stays planted when your body turns fast.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"feat\">\n    <div class=\"feat-img\">\n      <img src=\"https://in.hndrd.co/cdn/shop/files/Artboard4_b8a96387-0b66-4af8-b492-17a93efcbfd1.png?v=1780399331&width=650\" alt=\"HexaFoam Pro Midsole\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feat-copy\">\n      <span class=\"feat-num\">03</span>\n      <span class=\"feat-tag\">Midsole</span>\n      <h2 class=\"feat-title\">HexaFoam Pro Midsole</h2>\n      <p class=\"feat-body\">Dense foam geometry absorbs impact on every landing. Stays responsive across long training sessions - not just the first game of the day.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"feat\">\n    <div class=\"feat-img\">\n      <img src=\"https://in.hndrd.co/cdn/shop/files/Artboard5_e2d1a5d4-bb80-4004-b4a0-540182fec0fa.png?v=1780399330&width=650\" alt=\"X-Cushion Sole\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feat-copy\">\n      <span class=\"feat-num\">04</span>\n      <span class=\"feat-tag\">Outsole</span>\n      <h2 class=\"feat-title\">X-Cushion Sole</h2>\n      <p class=\"feat-body\">Multi-layered non-marking rubber with Active Grip patterning. Confident traction on every court surface - no slip on fast transitions.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n\n<!-- SPECS STRIP -->\n<div class=\"specs-strip\">\n  <div class=\"spec-item\"><div class=\"spec-label\">Weight</div><div class=\"spec-val\">330g</div></div>\n  <div class=\"spec-item\"><div class=\"spec-label\">Midsole</div><div class=\"spec-val\">HexaFoam Pro</div></div>\n  <div class=\"spec-item\"><div class=\"spec-label\">Outsole</div><div class=\"spec-val\">X-Cushion</div></div>\n  <div class=\"spec-item\"><div class=\"spec-label\">Player level</div><div class=\"spec-val\">Intermediate</div></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- COLORWAY CARDS -->\n<section class=\"colorway-section\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Pick your color</h2>\n    <a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/products/raze-pro-ii\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"section-link\">View all on product page</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"colorway-grid\">\n    <a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/products/raze-pro-ii\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cw-card\">\n      <div class=\"cw-card-img\"><img src=\"https://in.hndrd.co/cdn/shop/files/Artboard1_8e94bbf0-4afc-4185-9113-8d2fe0a7e940.png?v=1780399330&width=400\" alt=\"White/Red\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"cw-card-info\"><div class=\"cw-card-name\">White / Red</div><div class=\"cw-card-price\">&#8377;2,190</div></div>\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/products/raze-pro-ii?variant=52504900501797\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cw-card\">\n      <div class=\"cw-card-img\"><img src=\"https://in.hndrd.co/cdn/shop/files/Artboard_1_41af61bf-ebe0-4ba4-9498-81ed3eed0e8a.png?v=1780399351&width=400\" alt=\"White/Turquoise/Red\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"cw-card-info\"><div class=\"cw-card-name\">White / Turquoise / Red</div><div class=\"cw-card-price\">&#8377;2,190</div></div>\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/products/raz